# Nothing secret or local goes into the image (it is pushed to a registry that may be public).
# The Dockerfile also copies only app/, migrations/, alembic.ini and requirements.txt.
# A pattern without **/ matches only the top of the build context, so secrets are listed at any depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/id_rsa*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/users.json
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
tests
evals
.pytest_cache
